  "title": {
   "en": "Futari Wa Kari Tomo"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ふたりは仮友"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Chie Suzuki, who gave up on making friends back in elementary school, has spent her school life as a solitary \"cool beauty,\" content in her own little world. \n\nHowever, her current concern is the \"character overlap\" between herself and Satou, the \"Prince of Ice\"—a handsome, top-performing student who remains expressionless and distant. Frankly, she finds him a nuisance. But one day, Satou unexpectedly asks her, \"Will you be my friend?\"\n\nAs it turns out, behind his icy exterior, Satou is just a pure-hearted boy who struggles to connect with others and make friends. At first, Chie refuses his request, believing that you need a particular type skill to be able to make “friends,\" something she believes she lacks the aptitude for.  But then Satou proposes, \"How about we try being (temporary) friends, since neither of us really gets it?\"\n\nAnd so begins their tentative experiment in friendship!\n\n(Source: MangaMee, edited)",
   "ja": "小学生の頃に友達づくりを諦め、マイワールドに浸りながら孤高のクールビューティーとして学校生活を送っていた涼木千笑。 彼女の目下の懸念は、眉目秀麗・成績優秀ながら無表情で孤高を貫く「氷の王子」こと佐東とのキャラ被り。正直邪魔くさいーーなんて思っていたら、ある日佐東から「友達になってくれませんか」とお願いをされる事態に！佐東の素顔は、うまく周りに馴染めず友達を作ることができないだけのピュアボーイだったのだ！“友達”をするには特殊能力が必要と思いこんでいる涼木は当初佐東の願いを聞き入れなかったが、「わからない者同士、【仮】で友達をやってみるのはどうかな！？」と提案されて…？"
  },
